# Cerbo bridge — flash this repo

```bash
./scripts/esphome-flash.sh upload          # USB
./scripts/esphome-flash.sh upload-ota      # Wi-Fi (needs api + esp32_ip in secrets.yaml)
./scripts/esphome-flash.sh logs-ota        # wireless logs (api)
```

Set `esp32_ip: "192.168.x.x"` in `secrets.yaml` or `ESPHOME_OTA_HOST=...` for OTA commands.

Cerbo MQTT bridge YAML: no HA (`mqtt.discovery: false`); JSON on `/vatrer/battery` for **mr-manuel dbus-mqtt-battery** (see header in `vatrer-cerbo-ble.yaml`).

ESPHome binary policy: see **esphome-use-existing** rule (no per-project installs).
